{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Shadow Brutes are void spirit ",["l","怪物","Monsters"]," found in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," after floor 80. 150 void spirits (any type) need to be killed for the ",["l","探险家公会#Monster Eradication Goals","Monster Eradication Goal"]," at the ",["l","探险家公会","Adventurer's Guild"],". Both ",["l","暗影萨满","Shadow Shaman"]," and Shadow Brutes are counted toward this goal."]]]],["Behavior",2,[["p",["They have no special attacks, but resist ",["l","重量","knockback"],"."]]]],["Strategy",2,[["p",["Attack them, backing away when they get close."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.0","1.0"],": Introduced."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Added ",["l","暗影狂徒（危险）","Shadow Brute (dangerous)"]," and ",["l","暗影狙击手","Shadow Sniper"]," as stronger counterparts."]]]]]]]}